      <h1 class="h-xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:18px">Short version: this site does not ask you for anything and does not track you.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>Nothing directly. This site has no sign-up, no account, no newsletter, no comments, and no contact form. We do not ask for your name, your email, or anything about you.</p>

      <h2>What happens automatically</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Hosting.</strong> The site is hosted by Netlify. Like any web host, their servers record basic request information such as IP address and browser type. See the <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Netlify privacy policy</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Fonts.</strong> The site loads its typefaces from Google Fonts, which means your browser makes a request to Google. See the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google privacy policy</a>.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not use analytics, advertising, or tracking cookies.</p>

      <h2>If you email us</h2>
      <p>If you write to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>, we will have your email address and whatever you put in your message. We use it only to reply. We do not add you to a list and we do not share it.</p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>This site is written for a teenage audience. We do not knowingly collect personal information from anyone, including children under 13. If you believe a child has sent us personal information, email us and we will delete it.</p>

      <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
      <p>We link out to research databases, journals, and other sites. Once you follow a link, that site's privacy policy applies, not ours.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes, the date below changes with it.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about privacy: <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>

      <p class="post-meta" style="margin-top:40px">Last updated {{ site.year }}</p>
